  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tonga R2R Phase 2 PPG</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The marine biological diversity of the Kingdom of Tonga is critical to the wellbeing of its people and the foundation of their lifestyle. The Tongan economy heavily relies on the fisheries and marine resources, which in turn depend on the countrys rich biological diversity. However, this rich biological diversity is under threat from multiple sources, including habitat loss, degradation, overexploitation, invasive alien species, pollution, and climate change. Without its wetland and marine biodiversity, Tonga would lose its aesthetic, spiritual, and educational values, which are integral to the peoples wellbeing and traditional way of life.</narrative>
  </description>
